--TEST--
a cursor on a class's own declaration answers nothing however many sites allocate it, because a name is resolved off a recorded expression and a declaration is not one — the same seam that makes `definition` answer `none` here, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Us<|>er
{
    public string $name = "";
}

var $u = new User();
var $v = new User();
--REQUEST--
references
--EXPECT--
none
